# RapidR's compiler messages in Spanish (español neutro).
# A SAMPLE that proves the pipeline (lane I18N-STUDIO): a few messages
# only, each marked `review` until a person checks it against
# docs/i18n/glossary-es.md. The translation lanes complete it from
# compiler.pot (`rapidr i18n update`).
#
# msgctxt is the message's ID (never translated), msgid its English
# template, msgstr the translation: keep every {name} and the code as written.
